id=dnscrypt-proxy-android-pDNSf
name=DNSCrypt-Proxy for pDNSf
version=2.1.5.p
versionCode=210501
author=Oganesson403
description=A flexible DNS proxy, with support for modern encrypted DNS protocols such as DNSCrypt v2, DNS-over-HTTPS, Anonymized DNSCrypt and ODoH (Oblivious DoH). Using dnscrypt-proxy 2.1.5. Based on  quindecim/dnscrypt-proxy-android, modified to work with pDNSf.
